  "analysis_md": "$$\nx\\big|_{t=1}=e+3,\\quad y\\big|_{t=1}=e+2,\\quad z\\big|_{t=1}=-e-1,\n$$\n又\n$$\nx'_t\\big|_{t=1}=e+3,\\quad y'_t\\big|_{t=1}=2e+4,\\quad z'_t\\big|_{t=1}=-3e-3,\n$$\n则法平面方程为：\n$$\n(e+3)(x-e-3)+(2e+4)(y-e-2)-(3e+3)(z+e+1)=0,\n$$\n整理得：\n$$\n(e+3)x+(2e+4)y-(3e+3)z=6e^2+20e+20.\n$$",
